& [P3TALF-001] source predecessor profile and module binding
  + [support] source and processing manifests plus input audit bind exact selection, current authorities, profiles, modules, and zero-dependency boundary
  + [proof] exact path, byte, hash, signature, and future repository-diff table
  + [refusal] drift or implicit version stops canonicalization and implementation

& [P3TALF-002] claim versus producer provenance separation
  + [support] eight delineations, semantic nonmeanings, forbidden-inference graph, and absent-stage data model
  + [proof] public caller forms and pure ClaimOnly result have no path to admitted, issued, consumed, or physical state
  + [refusal] any form-as-fact or validator-as-producer edge fails

& [P3TALF-003] exact bounded acquisition identity
  + [support] nonzero-u64 logical-correlation model with no generator or uniqueness claim
  + [proof] zero refusal, stable serde, inequality, allocation-free bound, and explicit nonclaims
  + [refusal] free string, zero sentinel, random, clock, registry, or syntax-as-uniqueness fails

& [P3TALF-004] complete acquisition scope product
  + [support] complete root, profile, encoding, limit, policy, and predecessor coordinate table
  + [proof] every unequal coordinate denies structural equality and no separate shortcut identity exists
  + [refusal] omitted, optional, defaulted, wildcard, or partial scope fails

& [P3TALF-005] independent complete lineage and carrier binding
  + [support] each lineage owns one complete current ordered-digest carrier and transitive assembly ancestry
  + [proof] current validation, independent rederivation, tamper, substitution, and shortcut-absence cases
  + [refusal] peer assembly, bare digest, locator, key, lazy lookup, or caller summary fails

& [P3TALF-006] distinct ordered pair and causal relation
  + [support] exact First and Second ownership, identity inequality, complete scope equality, and explicit endpoint-bound clock-free edge
  + [proof] duplicate, swapped, self, inverse, wrong endpoint, and scope mismatch cases
  + [refusal] vector, JSON, operand, numeric, or lexical order inference fails

& [P3TALF-007] current reconciliation and Equal requirement
  + [support] exact current plan, operand binding, carrier rederivation, common scope, and Equal-or-Different disposition
  + [proof] stale profile, substitution, rederivation fault, Equal, and Different cases remain distinct
  + [refusal] direct digest equality or Equal-as-acquisition fails

& [P3TALF-008] non-authoritative repeated inventory claim
  + [support] requested NonAtomicRepeatedInventoryEqual, retained pair and reconciliation lineage, and explicit ClaimOnly output
  + [proof] output private fields, getters, Serialize only, unsupported grade rejection, and absent receipt conversion
  + [refusal] OsSnapshotProven, issued vocabulary, self-authorization, or stronger grade fails

& [P3TALF-009] production construction boundary
  + [support] admitted lineage and every token, trait, constructor, key, registry, and secret are completely deferred
  + [proof] canonical and static public-API absence plus explicit M2C source dependency
  + [refusal] placeholder admitted type or implementation-convenience widening fails

& [P3TALF-010] strict serde validation ownership visibility and resources
  + [support] strict type graph, exact validation order, two-lineage ownership, current nested bounds, and bounded diagnostics
  + [proof] round-trip, unknown-field, profile, order, visibility, resource, and static cases
  + [refusal] alias, default, flatten, untagged, catch-all, recursion, mutable output, or hidden lookup fails

& [P3TALF-011] closed atomic fault taxonomy
  + [support] ten exact codes with bounded field and message, first-fault order, and no partial result
  + [proof] exhaustive source-to-fault matrix preserves Different separately
  + [refusal] open code, unbounded cause, partial lineage, panic, or fictional Capability fault fails

& [P3TALF-012] adversarial provenance and construction tests
  + [support] fourteen-threat review plus positive, tamper, serde, role, rederivation, Different, and API-absence routes
  + [proof] focused unit and static target after signature
  + [refusal] trusted fixture wording, production bypass, ignored provenance case, or effectful harness fails

& [P3TALF-013] one-module zero-effect implementation boundary
  + [support] bounded build slice permits at most one safe pure module and one export with current dependencies
  + [proof] source, Cargo, lockfile, unsafe, import, cfg, and effect diffs
  + [refusal] second module, dependency, unsafe, platform, filesystem, clock, producer, issuer, or other effect fails

& [P3TALF-014] SJS proof provenance rollback and publication closure
  + [support] complete artifact chain, phase lock, signature, proof, evidence, narrative, reentry, rollback, and publication plan
  + [proof] every hash current, all exact gates pass, upstream equality holds, and tracked tree is clean
  + [refusal] skipped stage, stale signature, partial proof, dirty publication, or physical overclaim fails

